  "story": [
    [
      "What you’ll build",
      "<p>Data platforms, data models and AI solutions that reach production, not just demos. You work with Databricks, Microsoft Fabric, dbt, Dagster, Power BI and Azure, from well-modelled data products to RAG pipelines and agents, for clients in financial services, logistics, retail and the public sector.</p>"
    ],
    [
      "How you grow",
      "<p>You join one of our two competence centers, Data Engineering & Integration or Data Science & AI, where engineers share what they know. We invest in best practices, reference architectures and reusable frameworks, and senior colleagues review and coach the juniors on their projects.</p>"
    ],
    [
      "What you own",
      "<p>You make your own technical choices on projects and help decide how we work, from engineering practices to internal tooling. Knowledge sharing and ownership have shaped Acumen since 2007. Everyone at Acumen is a knowledge holder: what you learn, you share, and it shapes how we work.</p>"
    ]
  ],
